    {"en":"Thank you, Mr. Jackson.","cn":"谢谢，杰克逊先生。","source":"adaptation","pdfPage":37,"printedPage":33,"sourceFile":"电子资料/新概念英语第一册学生用书.pdf","verification":"candidate","translationSource":"supplement"},
    {"en":"This is Nicola Grey, and this is Claire Taylor.","cn":"这位是尼克拉·格雷，这位是克莱尔·泰勒。","source":"adaptation","pdfPage":37,"printedPage":33,"sourceFile":"电子资料/新概念英语第一册学生用书.pdf","verification":"candidate","translationSource":"supplement"},
    {"en":"How do you do?","cn":"你们好！","source":"adaptation","pdfPage":37,"printedPage":33,"sourceFile":"电子资料/新概念英语第一册学生用书.pdf","verification":"candidate","translationSource":"supplement"},
    {"en":"Those women are very hard-working. What are their jobs?","cn":"那些女职员工作很勤快。她们是做什么工作的？","source":"adaptation","pdfPage":37,"printedPage":33,"sourceFile":"电子资料/新概念英语第一册学生用书.pdf","verification":"candidate","translationSource":"supplement"},
    {"en":"They're keyboard operators.","cn":"她们是电脑录入员。","source":"adaptation","pdfPage":37,"printedPage":33,"sourceFile":"电子资料/新概念英语第一册学生用书.pdf","verification":"candidate","translationSource":"supplement"},
    {"en":"This is Michael Baker, and this is Jeremy Short.","cn":"这位是迈克尔·贝克，这位是杰里米·肖特。","source":"adaptation","pdfPage":37,"printedPage":33,"sourceFile":"电子资料/新概念英语第一册学生用书.pdf","verification":"candidate","translationSource":"supplement"},
    {"en":"How do you do?","cn":"你们好！","source":"adaptation","pdfPage":37,"printedPage":33,"sourceFile":"电子资料/新概念英语第一册学生用书.pdf","verification":"candidate","translationSource":"supplement"},
    {"en":"They aren't very busy. What are their jobs?","cn":"他们不很忙。他们是做什么工作的？","source":"adaptation","pdfPage":37,"printedPage":33,"sourceFile":"电子资料/新概念英语第一册学生用书.pdf","verification":"candidate","translationSource":"supplement"},
    {"en":"They're sales reps. They're very lazy.","cn":"他们是推销员，非常懒。","source":"adaptation","pdfPage":37,"printedPage":33,"sourceFile":"电子资料/新概念英语第一册学生用书.pdf","verification":"candidate","translationSource":"supplement"},
    {"en":"Who is this young man?","cn":"这个年轻人是谁？","source":"adaptation","pdfPage":37,"printedPage":33,"sourceFile":"电子资料/新概念英语第一册学生用书.pdf","verification":"candidate","translationSource":"supplement"},
    {"en":"This is Jim. He's our office assistant.","cn":"他是吉姆，是我们办公室的勤杂人员。","source":"adaptation","pdfPage":37,"printedPage":33,"sourceFile":"电子资料/新概念英语第一册学生用书.pdf","verification":"candidate","translationSource":"supplement"}
